### PRODUCT TEST

### GET PRODUCT
### GET ALL PRODUCTS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/product
### GET PRODUCT BY STORE
GET http://localhost:3000/api/product?storeId=10
### GET PRODUCT BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/product/100

### CREATE PRODUCT
### CREATE PRODUCT WITHOUT TOKEN
POST http://localhost:3000/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pen",
    "description": "Blue pen",
    "price": 5,
    "stock_quantity": 120
}
### CREATE PRODUCT WITH TOKEN BUT USER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pen",
    "description": "Blue pen",
    "price": 5,
    "stock_quantity": 120,
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjE1LCJpYXQiOjE3OTUzMjMwOTcsImV4cCI6MTc5NTQwOTQ5N30.-XEg8BXlgoXRrBkOtzMekSpzi5ZxMyvWn6EfugHjX6w"
}
### CREATE PRODUCT WITH SELLER TOKEN 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pen",
    "description": "Blue pen",
    "price": 5,
    "stock_quantity": 120,
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjE2LCJpYXQiOjE3OTUzMjMyOTEsImV4cCI6MTc5NTQwOTY5MX0.jEPd1_5Ib1tf_N2yQRQncD0pfn4Tjf-v2m3vrPxyz_E"
