### UPDATE PRODUCT
### UNAUTHORIZED UPDATE
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/product/12
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pen",
    "description": "Blue pen from other shop",
    "price": 5,
    "stock_quantity": 120,
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjE1LCJpYXQiOjE3OTUzMjM4NDcsImV4cCI6MTc5NTQxMDI0N30.cmewq5Q3oTr030D47uEUBjrcdU7XVx-UYv6lI-v4SO8"
}
